    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Thanks for your mini.nvim, I really like the feature-richness design, here're some modules I think can be made into mini.nvim.\r\n\r\n- `mini.cycle` likes https://github.com/zef/vim-cycle\r\n- `mini.lastplace` likes https://github.com/farmergreg/vim-lastplace or https://github.com/ethanholz/nvim-lastplace",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks for your mini.nvim, I really like the feature-richness design, here're some modules I think can be made into mini.nvim.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">mini.cycle</code> likes <a href=\"https://github.com/zef/vim-cycle\">https://github.com/zef/vim-cycle</a></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">mini.lastplace</code> likes <a href=\"https://github.com/farmergreg/vim-lastplace\">https://github.com/farmergreg/vim-lastplace</a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/ethanholz/nvim-lastplace\">https://github.com/ethanholz/nvim-lastplace</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "bodyText": "Thanks for your mini.nvim, I really like the feature-richness design, here're some modules I think can be made into mini.nvim.\n\nmini.cycle likes https://github.com/zef/vim-cycle\nmini.lastplace likes https://github.com/farmergreg/vim-lastplace or https://github.com/ethanholz/nvim-lastplace",
