            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thank you for your kind words and useful suggestions!\r\n\r\n- I already planned something along the lines of 'zef/vim-cycle'. Although, it is quite far in my backlog at the moment.\r\n- I have never heard about 'farmergreg/vim-lastplace'. Although I didn't quite get the purpose of plugin from reading README (three times), the source code seems to be quite small. Not really sure it is worth extra module, to be honest. Some day, maybe a function in 'mini.misc'.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Thank you for your kind words and useful suggestions!</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>I already planned something along the lines of 'zef/vim-cycle'. Although, it is quite far in my backlog at the moment.</li>\n<li>I have never heard about 'farmergreg/vim-lastplace'. Although I didn't quite get the purpose of plugin from reading README (three times), the source code seems to be quite small. Not really sure it is worth extra module, to be honest. Some day, maybe a function in 'mini.misc'.</li>\n</ul>",
