            "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Instead of `lastplace`, simply use this VimScript snippet, which is given somewhere in the Vim documentation:\r\n\r\n```vim\r\nautocmd BufReadPost * if line(\"'\\\"\") >= 1 && line(\"'\\\"\") <= line(\"$\") | exe \"normal! g`\\\"\" | endif\r\n```",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Instead of <code class=\"notranslate\">lastplace</code>, simply use this VimScript snippet, which is given somewhere in the Vim documentation:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-viml notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"autocmd BufReadPost * if line(&quot;'\\&quot;&quot;) &gt;= 1 &amp;&amp; line(&quot;'\\&quot;&quot;) &lt;= line(&quot;$&quot;) | exe &quot;normal! g`\\&quot;&quot; | endif\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">autocmd</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">BufReadPost</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">*</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">line</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>'<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">&gt;=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">1</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">line</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>'<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">&lt;=</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">line</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>$<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>) | <span class=\"pl-c1\">exe</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>normal! g`<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> | <span class=\"pl-k\">endif</span></pre></div>",
            "bodyText": "Instead of lastplace, simply use this VimScript snippet, which is given somewhere in the Vim documentation:\nautocmd BufReadPost * if line(\"'\\\"\") >= 1 && line(\"'\\\"\") <= line(\"$\") | exe \"normal! g`\\\"\" | endif",
